      : Ideal (integralClosure ℤ (AlgebraicClosure ℚ)), 𝔔.IsMaximal ∧ (q : integralClosure ℤ
      (AlgebraicClosure ℚ)) ∈ 𝔔 ∧ ∀ b : integralClosure ℤ (AlgebraicClosure ℚ), ∃ c ∈ 𝔔, (c :
